---
// The full-window band every instrument takes inside a study page: it breaks
// out of the text column to the width and height of the window and snaps into
// place as it is scrolled to. The slot holds the instrument; a study that needs
// its own values in an instrument's menu places its own Svelte wrapper here.
---

<div class="instrument-embed"><slot /></div>

<style is:global>
/* A page holding an instrument snaps to it while scrolling past. */
html:has(.instrument-embed) {
  scroll-snap-type: y proximity;
  overflow-x: clip;
}
</style>
<style>
.instrument-embed {
  width: 100vw;
  height: 100svh;
  margin-inline: calc(50% - 50vw);
  scroll-snap-align: center;
}
</style>
